From 9507b74462201ea55a7f3d85be640d919afdc9a8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Justin <justurn@live.com>
Date: Sat, 27 Jun 2026 02:08:55 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(Core/Spells): Split Stonebond scripts from F-164
 (F-164S)

Extract the Stonebond C++ out of the consolidated F-164 Earthwarden core-scripts
commit into its own [F-164S] patch: the three SPELL_SHAMAN_STONEBOND_{SPLIT,
MARKER,PULSE} enums, the GetStonebondPct helper, the spell_sha_stonebond and
spell_sha_stonebond_pulse scripts and their RegisterSpellScript lines
(spell_shaman.cpp), plus the Earth Elemental damage-soak mode (pet_shaman.cpp).
No behaviour change.
---
 src/server/scripts/Pet/pet_shaman.cpp      | 49 +++++++++--
 src/server/scripts/Spells/spell_shaman.cpp | 98 ++++++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 141 insertions(+), 6 deletions(-)

